<title>ITALY: Autostrade priv shares to be converted.</title>
<headline>Autostrade priv shares to be converted.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privileged shares in motorway operator Autostrade will be converted into ordinary shares at par with no cash balance, Autostrade's parent company Iri said in a statement.</p>
<p>Autostrade is due to be privatised later this summer.</p>
</text>
